{"id":"n67285-2-3","stage":1,"title":"언제나 · 何时","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67285-2-3-1","ko":"텔레비전에서 나오는 저기, 경치 정말 좋다.","zh":"电视里播放的那个地方，风景真好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"텔레비전에서","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"텔레비전에서","audio":"/audio/18b6aae84465bb0a47e8.mp3"}},{"text":"나오는","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오는","audio":"/audio/ab94724395205c5879e3.mp3"}},{"text":"저기,","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"경치","meaning":"风景，景色","explanation":"경치：风景，景色","readings":[{"term":"경치","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26024","senseId":"1","lemma":"경치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경치","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"좋다.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"b590a66bb114caf5","term":"경치","zh":"风景，景色","audio":"/audio/b590a66bb114caf5d529.mp3","entryId":"26024","definition":"自然或地区美丽的样子。","pronunciation":["경치"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0bc1d03812ada37278ad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67285-2-3-2","ko":"응, 언제나 저런 곳에 가 볼 수 있으려나.","zh":"嗯，不知道什么时候才能去那种地方看看呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"언제나","meaning":"何时","explanation":"언제나：何时","readings":[{"term":"언제나","audio":"/audio/84e71f1184644498ff69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67285","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제나","audio":"/audio/84e71f1184644498ff69.mp3"}},{"text":"저런","meaning":"那样的","explanation":"저런：那样的","readin